flowchart TD
    Start([User launches WindowsHealingSystem.ps1]) --> AdminCheck{Is Admin?}
    AdminCheck -- No --> UAC[Prompt for UAC & Restart] --> Stop([Exit Current])
    AdminCheck -- Yes --> Init[Initialize Variables & Dot-Source Scripts]
    
    Init --> ArgCheck{CLI args / Presets provided?}
    ArgCheck -- Yes --> CLIMode[Bypass GUI, Parse Args]
    ArgCheck -- No --> GUIMode[Show-MainWindow.ps1]

    GUIMode --> GUILoad[Load XAML & Parse Features.json]
    GUILoad --> UserInteract[User selects Tweaks & Apps]
    UserInteract --> ApplyBtn[User clicks Apply]
    ApplyBtn --> BuildParams[Generate script:Params]
    BuildParams --> ShowModal[Show-ApplyModal.ps1]

    CLIMode --> ExecAll[ExecuteAllChanges]
    ShowModal -->|Background Job| ExecAll

    ExecAll --> LoopParams{For each selected param}
    LoopParams -->|Next| ExecParam[ExecuteParameter]
    
    ExecParam --> Route{Action Type?}
    Route -- App Removal --> RemoveApps[RemoveApps.ps1]
    Route -- Tweak --> ImportReg[ImportRegistryFile.ps1]
    Route -- System Feature --> EnableFeat[EnableWindowsFeature.ps1]

    Route --> LoopParams
    LoopParams -->|Done| RestartExp{Restart Explorer?}
    RestartExp -- Yes --> DoRestart[RestartExplorer] --> Finish([Done])
    RestartExp -- No --> Finish